- Ask the Ark server before canceling a Lightning receive
  `Wallet::cancel_lightning_receive` needs the Ark server for an invoice
  that is waiting for payment. When the server does not cancel the
  invoice, the wallet asks it for the payment status and cancels only if
  no payment has arrived or the server already canceled the invoice. A
  payment that the server accepted stays claimable.
  [#24](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/24)
